{
  "name": "connection-lease",
  "note": "阶段 1 项 3 的连接租约。每条变异都是一种「页面看起来正常、掉线判定实际失效」的写法：判定不发生、判定过晚、判定发生但席位再也回不来、或者席位释放后凭据与会话留在内存里。beacon 相关的变异刻意集中在「beacon 成了唯一依据」这一类——要求里那句「不能作为唯一断线依据」正是这个意思。",
  "mutations": [
    {
      "id": "lease-never-expires",
      "file": "src/host/table-web-host.cjs",
      "needle": "        if (at - seen <= this.connectionLeaseMs) continue;",
      "replacement": "        if (true) continue;",
      "test": "test/connection-lease.test.cjs",
      "note": "扫描永不判过期。这一版回到了改动之前的世界：关标签页、刷新、拔网线之后那一席永远是 connected，保留窗永不起算，位子永不还。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lease-expires-immediately",
      "file": "src/host/table-web-host.cjs",
      "needle": "        if (at - seen <= this.connectionLeaseMs) continue;",
      "replacement": "        if (false) continue;",
      "test": "test/connection-lease.test.cjs",
      "note": "反方向：每次扫描把所有连接都判掉线。正在轮询的人也会被判掉线，所以「持续轮询不掉线」那条必须存在——只测「不轮询会掉线」时这一版也是绿的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lease-boundary-off-by-one",
      "file": "src/host/table-web-host.cjs",
      "needle": "        if (at - seen <= this.connectionLeaseMs) continue;",
      "replacement": "        if (at - seen <= this.connectionLeaseMs * 2) continue;",
      "test": "test/connection-lease.test.cjs",
      "note": "租约悄悄翻倍。判定还会发生，只是迟一倍，于是「掉线后 120 秒释放」变成「16 秒 + 120 秒」。没有一条断言盯住阈值时这种改动完全看不出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lease-measured-from-open",
      "file": "src/host/table-web-host.cjs",
      "needle": "        const seen = session.last_seen.get(connectionId) ?? session.opened_at;",
      "replacement": "        const seen = session.opened_at;",
      "test": "test/connection-lease.test.cjs",
      "note": "从开会话起算而不是从最后一次续租起算。一桌人打满 8 秒之后全体被判掉线——租约变成了会话寿命上限。"
    },
    {
      "id": "connect-does-not-start-lease",
      "file": "src/host/table-web-host.cjs",
      "needle": "    session.last_seen.set(connectionId, this.now());\n    return connectionId;\n  }",
      "replacement": "    return connectionId;\n  }",
      "test": "test/connection-lease.test.cjs",
      "note": "建连接时不记时间。回落到 opened_at 之后，一个在会话开了很久之后才打开的新窗口会在第一次扫描时立刻被判掉线。"
    },
    {
      "id": "touch-does-not-renew",
      "file": "src/host/table-web-host.cjs",
      "needle": "    if (session.connections.has(connectionId)) {\n      session.last_seen.set(connectionId, this.now());\n      return connectionId;\n    }",
      "replacement": "    if (session.connections.has(connectionId)) {\n      return connectionId;\n    }",
      "test": "test/connection-lease.test.cjs",
      "note": "续租这一步空转。正常轮询的页面在一个租约周期后被判掉线，而它自己看到的牌桌一直在更新——玩家完全不知道同桌已经把自己当掉线的人。"
    },
    {
